# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub Pages: this repository IS the website.
#
# NEVER commit secrets here — everything in this folder is public.
# The Creator Studio stores its passphrase hash and the GitHub token
# in the browser's localStorage, never in these files.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Node (only if you ever add tooling)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Local-only exports (regenerated by the Creator Studio)
config.js

# Smoke-test workspace (headless Chrome dumps, profiles, diagnostics)
.tmp-check/
